        ecrm:P32_used_general_technique
                "Jacquard woven. Plain weave (grey with white stripe) with a supplementary warp (purple). In the centers of the flowers the supplementary warp shares a complementaryfunction with the white warp"@en , "allowing it to float on the front. The long floats between motifs on the back were cut away after weaving a part of thefinishing process. Loomed width: 23 inches"@en ;
